---
import SocialLinks from "../components/SocialLinks.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About – Latchlern Jack"
  description="About Latch, a software engineer and designer based in London."
>
  <main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-3xl flex-1 flex-col gap-6 px-12 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">About</h1>
    <p>
      I've always been curious about how things work. As a kid I was constantly
      taking things apart just to see what was inside. That curiosity eventually
      led me to programming, where I found I enjoyed solving problems just as
      much as building things.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of my work revolves around TypeScript, React and modern web
      technologies, but I'm always learning. Recently I've been spending more
      time exploring system design, networking, cloud infrastructure and the
      foundations that sit beneath the frameworks we use every day.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of software you'll usually find me at the gym, reading comics,
      watching anime, cooking or working on side projects. I'm also becoming
      increasingly interested in electronics and embedded systems, and I'm
      excited to see where that curiosity takes me next.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold">Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Say hello on LinkedIn, or see what I'm building on GitHub.</p>
    <SocialLinks />
  </main>
</Layout>
